        "title": "The diagram details the process of producing olive oil. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KPZ6dAJ1Bo0MvRxgSs8lBPSwgCe\"><em><strong>The diagram details the process of producing olive oil. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>&nbsp;IELTS Writing Task&nbsp; 1 - Olive Oil Production Process</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản xuất dầu &ocirc; liu từ việc thu hoạch đến khi tạo ra th&agrave;nh phẩm.</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh sản xuất dầu &ocirc; liu - từ nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc; đến th&agrave;nh phẩm</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WC1CdzFMdosCLcxEsW2l4ctEgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Quy tr&igrave;nh bao gồm <strong>một số giai đoạn ch&iacute;nh <em>(several main stages)</em></strong></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&aacute;c giai đoạn được nh&oacute;m th&agrave;nh: <strong>thu hoạch v&agrave; l&agrave;m sạch ban đầu (initial fruit collection and cleaning)</strong>, <strong>chiết xuất dầu bằng cơ học (mechanical oil extraction), v&agrave; t&aacute;ch/lưu trữ sản phẩm cuối c&ugrave;ng (final separation and storage)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Giai đoạn thu hoạch v&agrave; chiết xuất</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Quả &ocirc; liu được <strong>thu hoạch</strong> từ c&acirc;y v&agrave; <strong>bỏ v&agrave;o bể chứa</strong> (collection vats), nơi ch&uacute;ng được <strong>loại bỏ l&aacute; v&agrave; rửa sạch</strong> (subjected to leaf removal and washing)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Quả đ&atilde; l&agrave;m sạch được <strong>chuyển đến m&aacute;y nghiền</strong> (olive mill) v&agrave; <strong>nghiền th&agrave;nh bột nh&atilde;o</strong> (crushed to form an olive paste)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Bột nh&atilde;o n&agrave;y sau đ&oacute; trải qua qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh <strong>nh&agrave;o trộn</strong> (malaxation) ở <strong>nhiệt độ dưới 27&deg;C,</strong>&nbsp;một bước trộn nhẹ nh&agrave;ng gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c giọt dầu nhỏ <strong>kết hợp lại</strong> (coalesce)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Sau khi nh&agrave;o trộn, bột nh&atilde;o được đưa v&agrave;o <strong>m&aacute;y ly t&acirc;m</strong> (centrifugal separator/centrifuge) để <strong>chiết xuất v&agrave; t&aacute;ch dầu</strong> khỏi phần rắn</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Giai đoạn xử l&yacute; v&agrave; lưu trữ</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Phần chất lỏng chiết xuất được <strong>xử l&yacute; tiếp</strong> để tạo ra dầu ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng v&agrave; c&aacute;c d&ograve;ng chất thải (treated to yield consumable oil and waste streams)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>Dầu nguy&ecirc;n chất</strong> (virgin oil) đầu ti&ecirc;n được chuyển đến <strong>bộ phận lắng</strong> (decanter) để <strong>l&agrave;m trong</strong> (clarification), cho ph&eacute;p chất rắn v&agrave; nước lắng xuống</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Phần chất lỏng c&ograve;n lại đi qua <strong>giai đoạn t&aacute;ch</strong> (separation stage) để loại bỏ <strong>nước thải</strong> (wastewater), trong khi dầu tinh khiết được thu thập</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"><strong>B&atilde; &ocirc; liu</strong> (pomace), phần cặn rắn được t&aacute;ch ra từ m&aacute;y ly t&acirc;m v&agrave; <strong>vận chuyển</strong> đến c&aacute;c nh&agrave; m&aacute;y tinh chế để xử l&yacute; th&ecirc;m</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Cuối c&ugrave;ng, dầu đ&atilde; l&agrave;m trong được <strong>đưa v&agrave;o bể chứa</strong> (storage tank), sẵn s&agrave;ng để đ&oacute;ng chai hoặc ph&acirc;n phối</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2868,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtUxddRf8oYxYVx5qj5lRdHdgBe\">The diagram illustrates the procedure for producing olive oil from harvested olives.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37173,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2869,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PZ0idRMLAo6sdOxl5N0lAfM3gXb\">Overall, the process comprises several main stages: initial fruit collection and cleaning, mechanical oil extraction and final separation and storage of the products.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37173,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2870,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRtcdozUWok2POxFJJll7Dx2gvg\">Looking at the initial stages, olives are picked from the trees and deposited into collection vats where they are subjected to leaf removal and washing. Next, the cleaned fruit is transferred to an olive mill and crushed to form an olive paste. This paste then undergoes malaxation at temperatures below 27&deg;C, a gentle mixing step that helps small oil droplets coalesce. After malaxation, the paste is directed into a centrifugal separator (centrifuge), where the bulk of the oil is mechanically extracted and separated from the solid material.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37173,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2871,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QFcFd7hh5ofcB5xu4hGlxVdVgle\">From this stage onwards, the extracted liquid stream is subsequently treated to yield consumable oil and waste streams. Virgin oil is first transferred to a decanter for clarification, allowing solids and water to settle out. Any remaining liquid is passed through a separation stage in which residual wastewater is removed and either treated or discharged as effluent, while the purified oil is collected. The solid residue, or pomace, is removed from the centrifuge and transported for further refining or processing at specialist facilities. Finally, the clarified oil is deposited into a storage tank, ready for bottling or distribution.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37173,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
